id: controlled-shock
name: Controlled Shock
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score of 6+
tpCost: 10
# Not built: Reduced Momentum is a rule this system does not have yet - its text is coming (the user's ruling,
# 2026-10-02). Until then, the table's.
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Knocked through a Health Threshold by Holstein Shock: no Reduced Momentum.
text: >
  Controlled Shock: You apply bodily harm in a carefully controlled manner to avoid undue stress on your body.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score of 6+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: If you knock yourself through a Health Threshold through the use of the Holstein Shock Unique Ability, do not
  apply Reduced Momentum.
